're a Tentacle Monster, and your goal is to escape and conquer the research facility that captured and currently contains you. However, this research facility is protected by armed guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can conquer an area in the game by possessing lockers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press arrow keys or A / D to navigate each locker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.poster.avif?t=1769853786\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.webm?t=1769853786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/2326ebb2d2b4d8b92ddb945d94432d4e.mp4?t=1769853786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press SPACE to capture a Scientist target.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.poster.avif?t=1769853786\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.webm?t=1769853786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578980/extras/c3446a1aab13261c2dd98eb43ede9355.mp4?t=1769853786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press ENTER to view the current scene of the current locker.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph